    "description": {
      "value": "Heavenly radiance shines from an active celestial staff, a golden staff capped with a pair of sculpted angel's wings. Used as a weapon, the staff is a staff. While wielding a celestial staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against effects that have the evil trait and effects created by evil creatures. When you prepare this staff, if you're evil, you become drained 1 until your next daily preparations.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **Cantrip:** divine lance (good only)\n- - **1st:** bless, protection\n- - **2nd:** continual flame, inner radiance torrent\n- - **3rd:** circle of protection, sanctified ground\n- - **4th:** holy cascade, inner radiance torrent\n- - **5th:** spiritual guardian, summon celestial\n- - **6th:** holy cascade, summon celestial\n- - **7th:** angel form, inner radiance torrent, summon celestial"
    },
